{
 "lines": [
  {
   "file": "takes/00.wav",
   "start": 0.1,
   "speech_end": 2.54,
   "text": "This car just crossed the median and hit an SUV head-on."
  },
  {
   "file": "takes/01.wav",
   "start": 2.84,
   "speech_end": 2.44,
   "text": "That's why highways put a concrete wall down the middle."
  },
  {
   "file": "takes/02.wav",
   "start": 5.48,
   "speech_end": 2.02,
   "text": "But look at the bottom. It's sloped."
  },
  {
   "file": "takes/03.wav",
   "start": 7.7,
   "speech_end": 2.48,
   "text": "Against a flat wall, the body takes the hit."
  },
  {
   "file": "takes/04.wav",
   "start": 10.38,
   "speech_end": 6.36,
   "text": "Here, the tire hits first and climbs. The car lifts, the tires grip less, and the wall slides it back into its lane."
  },
  {
   "file": "takes/05.wav",
   "start": 16.94,
   "speech_end": 1.4,
   "text": "No wall? This happens."
  },
  {
   "file": "takes/06.wav",
   "start": 19.14,
   "speech_end": 6.2,
   "text": "In August, on New Jersey's Route 55, a car crossed a grass median and killed a sixty-eight-year-old man driving the other way."
  },
  {
   "file": "takes/07.wav",
   "start": 25.54,
   "speech_end": 2.08,
   "text": "The state that invented the Jersey barrier."
  }
 ],
